sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant S as System
    
    note over Client, S: 1 — Browse Inventory
    Client->>GW: Browse Items
    GW->>S: get items
    S-->>GW: Items request queued
    GW-->>Client: Items request queued
    S-->>S: request items
    S-->>Client: Return requested items

    note over Client, S: 2 — Create Order
    Client->>GW: Place Order { itemList }
    GW->>S: create order { itemList }
    S-->>GW: Order creation initiated
    GW-->>Client: Order creation initiated
    S-->>S: create order { clientId, itemList }
    S-->>Client: payment_intent_created { orderId, clientSecret }

    note over Client, S: 3 — Confirm Order
    Client->>GW: Confirm Order { orderId, paymentToken }
    GW->>S: confirm order
    S-->>GW: Order confirmation initiated
    GW-->>Client: Order confirmation initiated
    S-->>S: update order status to order_confirmed
    S-->>S: reserve items { orderId, itemList }

    alt All items in stock
        S-->>S: reservation confirmed
        S-->>S: charge payment { orderId, paymentToken }

        alt Charge succeeds
            S-->>S: payment completed
            S-->>Client: notify payment_completed { orderId }
            S-->>S: update order status to pending_delivery
            S-->>S: update delivery status to ready_for_pickup

        else Charge declined
            S-->>S: payment failed
            S-->>S: release reserved items
            S-->>S: notify payment failed
            S-->>Client: payment_failed { orderId }
        end

    else Item unavailable or out of stock
        S-->>S: reservation failed
        S-->>Client: reservation_failed { orderId }
    end